SUMMARY:RAD WOMEN\, femme comedy in the RAD
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nModelface Comedy brings the best comedia
 ns from all over the country to Asheville\, NC. This week we are excited t
 o have an all femme show with a secret headliner!\nWe are celebrating with
  some truly RAD Women! Join some of the best femme comedians from Ashevill
 e and a secret lady headliner for a night of unforgettable laughs at The R
 AD Brew Co. in the River Arts District!\nages 18+\n\nDoors at 6:30pm\, sho
 w at 7pm\nTickets $15 advance\, $18 day of\n[https://www.eventbrite.com/..
 ./rad-women-femme-comedy-in...](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/rad-women-fem
 me-comedy-in-the-rad-tickets-1994871059038?aff=oddtdtcreator&fbclid=IwcGRv
 ZgFleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFaMmJZRmp0REc0ZWNjcWN4c3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MT
 c4ODIwMDg5MgABHssjcrfpEtaH1l68rgAzOij2JXiIUKN1qQR9iTqxugC_8MYIzqY_DWpZ7EUg
 _aem_cGpYYM6MTJ9vAcj82ZxbZA)
