BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_315938982@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260804T032732Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260818T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260818T203000
SUMMARY:Sapphic Book Club!  - July
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nOur book club read for August is *When E
 verything Was Fresh and Green* by Bethany Tap.\n\nWhen Tessa\, a single fo
 ster mom\, is charged with the care of Astrid\, an abandoned teen witch\, 
 the world as she knew it disappears. Discovering secrets about her lost fo
 ster child Theo\, Tessa follows Astrid and a fabulous witch named Cece to 
 a magical house. There\, she joins the ranks of Magix\, including a burly 
 siren\, a snake-charming ogress\, a morbid little vampire\, a pair of wild
  werewolf toddlers\, and a coven of ice fairies\, all of whom are in hidin
 g from a murderous organization hell-bent on destroying the magical and no
 n-magical worlds alike.\n\n++\n\n[Read full synopsis here at The StoryGrap
 h](https://beta.thestorygraph.com/books/b29dc927-8b00-4f90-91cc-98f0a9b0b8
 63)\n\n***\\*\\*\\****\n\nWe'll meet at **White Duck Taco** in South Ashev
 ille \\(off Long Shoals Rd\\) \\|\\| Come early if you want some yummy foo
 d and drinks\\!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/315938982/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260801T223327Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260801T223327Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_315885473@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260804T032732Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260905T150000
SUMMARY:Let’s Craft!
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nGreetings everyone! Let’s get together
  and craft while snacking on pie! You can bring whatever craft you’re in
 to\, though please don’t bring anything too big/messy (e.g. no mural pai
 nting) since we want everyone to have space to work and need to leave the 
 place spotless!\n\nThe Baked Pie Company has an ever rotating selection of
  award-winning pies (as well as quiche and salad)\; they even have pie fli
 ghts! They also feature sugar free\, gluten free\, keto and vegan pies for
  those with dietary needs. So let's grab a slice of pie and build some com
 munity!\n\nDon't worry if you can't make this one\, though! It’s a month
 ly event\; you'll have plenty of chances to get your pie on :)\n\nYou can 
 check out the menu here:\nhttps://www.bakedpiecompany.com/list-of-pies
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/315885473/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260729T052417Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T052417Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Queers to the Front!
UID:event_315151068@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260804T032732Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T210000
SUMMARY:Josie Beers Gets Weirds
DESCRIPTION:Queers to the Front!\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best co
 medians from all over the country to Asheville\, NC. This week we are exci
 ted to have local legend Josie Beers!\n\nJoise Beers Gets Weirds\nInside J
 osie Beers are two dragons. One is a 83 year old Korean war vet\, and the 
 other\, a powerful thirty-something transwoman. After escaping the shutdow
 n mines of central Pennsylvania and taming her inner dragons\, she calls W
 NC home.\n\nfeaturing Derek Boskovich\n\nages 18+\nDoors at 6:30pm\, show 
 at 7pm\nTickets $15
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/queers-to-the-front/events/315151068/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260607T205337Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260607T205337Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
